# 0258 = 0257 + program the EP1 TX/RX FIFO base at 0 (vendor TWRP
#   readback 0x00090000 for both directions; mainline allocates in 512 B
#   units from base 0, the old 0x40 RX base is not a unit multiple), and
#   add read-only diagnostics: DEVICE_CONF speed, QCR2, TX/RX CSR1/CSR2.
